        "heading_wPhVgD": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "What are the Common Adhesive Tapes Used in the Safety Industry?",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "rich_text_cstm": "<p>Safety tapes encompass a wide range of adhesive and non-adhesive solutions for a variety of different environments and uses. However, their primary goal is to enhance the safety of employees and customers. Some of the most common safety tapes include:</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_w8RiKT": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Anti-Slip Tapes",
            "content": "<p>Also known as anti-skid or non-skid tapes, anti-slip tapes are characterized by a rough surface that helps to prevent individuals from slipping and falling. They are particularly useful in moist and slippery environments to provide an abrasive surface that provides firmer footing. Anti-slip tapes have the added advantage of bright coloring, which helps to bring attention to high-risk areas. Anti-slip tapes see frequent use on stairways, catwalks, walkways, and steps in environments with a high slip and fall potential.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_tVVp8w": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Barricade Tapes",
            "content": "<p>Barricade tapes warn of hazardous areas and limit access to sensitive areas. As a non-adhesive tape, barricade tapes are typically elevated to provide highly visible warnings in a wide variety of colors and prints. The most common forms of barrier tape often include words such as “Caution” or “Danger.”</p><p>Custom barricade tape is also available for unique situations. The goal of barricade tape is to catch the eye and prevent individuals from entering unsafe spaces, thereby reducing the risk of damage or injury. To ensure reliability in a wide range of conditions, barricade tapes are weather resistant and can be used indoors and outdoors.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_c4a4p8": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Glow-in-the-Dark Tapes",
            "content": "<p>As the name indicates, this type of tape is designed to emit light in in dark or poorly lit spaces. Glow-in-the-dark tapes absorb light energy emitted by nearby sources and use that energy to glow for hours after the lights go out. In many workplaces, these tapes enhance safety and reduce potential trip hazards in badly lit areas.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
