        "text_aHMH7i": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At <a href=\"/\" title=\"/\">NADCO</a>, we understand the importance of highly visible and durable safety tapes. Our selection of stock and custom adhesive tapes enhance awareness and improve the overall safety of individuals in a variety of environments. From anti-slip tapes to barricade and glow-in-the-dark tapes, we have the ability to produce superior quality tape products quickly and efficiently. We are proud to provide a versatile range of indoor and outdoor safety tapes for customers in retail, commercial, municipal, residential, and industrial settings.</p><p>With competitive pricing and a speedy turnaround on even the most complex or specialized adhesive safety tapes, it is no surprise that NADCO is an industry leader in custom adhesive tapes and labels. To learn more about our extensive array of stock adhesive tapes and custom design capabilities, <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact us\">contact the experts at NADCO today</a>!</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
